                <head>43. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>In a memorandum to the President dated November 10, Secretary of State Herter
                    recommended that, in view of the positive development of U.S. relations with
                    Romania and Bulgaria in recent months, the Legations at Bucharest and Sofia be
                    raised to Embassy status at an early date. The President rejected the
                    suggestion. See Part 1, <ref target="#d34">Document 34</ref>.</p>
            </div>
